#: ../../source/3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md:1 72577a9dae7843fe85e50daa7fe798ef
msgid "分体控制 vs 全身控制"
msgstr "分体控制 vs 全身控制"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md:3 d2f0e890eec94cb3ab8fd99802852857
msgid ""
"Two real launch paths in [ocs2_arm_controller](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/tree/main/controller/ocs2_arm_controller/launch), "
"also offered as **split body** / **full body** in the [open-deploy-ws "
"`arx-lift2s` README](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/open-deploy-ws/blob"
"/arx-lift2s/README.EN.md)."
msgstr ""
"[ocs2_arm_controller](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/tree/main/controller/ocs2_arm_controller/launch) "
"中有两条真实 launch 路径，在 [open-deploy-ws `arx-lift2s` "
"README](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/open-deploy-ws/blob/arx-"
"lift2s/README.EN.md) 中也对应 **分体** / **全身**。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md c1437964490e4cc094b2976bfafd7cc8
msgid "**分体控制** (Split Body)"
msgstr "**分体控制**"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md f31e04a758384057a1e222afeddd139f
msgid "**全身控制** (Full Body)"
msgstr "**全身控制**"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md 5e4dc4fa7d084710af7c9821a7ec069d
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md b0d552fbb13f480786703e28f6ea9bc6
msgid ""
"Arms and body/head (and typically dexterous hands) run as **separate** "
"controllers"
msgstr "手臂与身体/头（通常还有灵巧手）由**各自独立**的控制器运行"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md b568a77a4b104f9b9b435ef1501f614a
msgid "One **unified** whole-body MPC controller"
msgstr "一个**统一**的全身 MPC 控制器"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md 2b791d2eeb584744b5cd446e42845c83
msgid "Arm / body"
msgstr "手臂 / 身体"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md 1568e14a41ad42139893f8cff35133fc
msgid ""
"[OCS2 Arm "
"Controller](../4-reference/controllers/2-ocs2_arm_controller.md) + [Basic"
" Joint "
"Controller](../4-reference/controllers/7-basic_joint_controller.md) "
"(`setup_body_controllers` for `body` and `head`)"
msgstr ""
"[OCS2 Arm "
"Controller](../4-reference/controllers/2-ocs2_arm_controller.md) + "
"[`Basic Joint "
"Controller`](../4-reference/controllers/7-basic_joint_controller.md)（`setup_body_controllers`"
" 用于 `body` 和 `head`）"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md 9d20bf5a310c4ad8882bbdd7b95d6097
msgid ""
"[OCS2 WBC Controller](../4-reference/controllers/3-ocs2_wbc.md) using "
"`ocs2_wheel_humanoid`"
msgstr ""
"[OCS2 WBC Controller](../4-reference/controllers/3-ocs2_wbc.md)，使用 "
"`ocs2_wheel_humanoid`"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md 0f95f2ac103b458c8fe66152f15969ad
msgid "Launch"
msgstr "启动"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md 46361cce94314ad3abfaa6ca954dbbc1
msgid ""
"`ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller split_body.launch.py` (`launch_mode` "
"`split_body`)"
msgstr ""
"`ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller split_body.launch.py`（`launch_mode` "
"`split_body`）"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md 23709189322f4d72953452e2cf2d3865
msgid ""
"`ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller full_body.launch.py` (`launch_mode` "
"`full_body`) when the robot config type is "
"`ocs2_wbc_controller/Ocs2WbcController`"
msgstr ""
"当机器人配置 type 为 `ocs2_wbc_controller/Ocs2WbcController` 时：`ros2 launch "
"ocs2_arm_controller full_body.launch.py`（`launch_mode` `full_body`）"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md ee9001ca83624d149e1c80e638d9e735
msgid "Lift2S menu"
msgstr "Lift2S 菜单"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md f1f628c0a74343d1b1e01082c400102e
msgid "`./quick_start.sh` → Launch → Lift2S → **split body**"
msgstr "`./quick_start.sh` → Launch → Lift2S → **分体**（菜单：`split body`）"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md 95806075b08a42e6b10bf6bba3f0cb33
msgid "same menu → **full body**"
msgstr "同一菜单 → **全身**（菜单：`full body`）"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md:12
#: cd0494b5cc514b2381496b84a41fb40d
msgid ""
"`split_body.launch.py` is the 分体控制 (Split Body) path. 全身控制 uses "
"`full_body.launch.py` (there is no public standalone `ros2 launch "
"ocs2_wbc_controller …` entry)."
msgstr ""
"`split_body.launch.py` 是分体控制路径。全身控制用 `full_body.launch.py`（没有公开的单独 `ros2 "
"launch ocs2_wbc_controller …` 入口）。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md:14
#: cef9af9d98b447dba3f892703f0f2505
msgid "Packages"
msgstr "软件包"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md:16
#: 20b5e12e022a4b7a92a6818e201c21d0
msgid ""
"**Basic Joint Controller** (`basic_joint_controller`) — joint FSM HOME / "
"HOLD / MOVEJ; `/fsm_command` is `std_msgs/Int32`. How-to: [Use Basic "
"Joint Controller](../2-how_to/4-controllers/11-basic_joint.md)."
msgstr ""
"**`Basic Joint Controller`**（`basic_joint_controller`）— 关节 FSM HOME / "
"HOLD / MOVEJ；`/fsm_command` 是 `std_msgs/Int32`。操作指南：[`Use Basic Joint "
"Controller`](../2-how_to/4-controllers/11-basic_joint.md)。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md:17
#: f6372fb05d284b0c9b8f1c207a867bce
msgid ""
"**OCS2 Arm Controller** (`ocs2_arm_controller`) — arm MPC FSM HOME / OCS2"
" / HOLD (package README)."
msgstr ""
"**`OCS2 Arm Controller`**（`ocs2_arm_controller`）— 手臂 MPC FSM HOME / OCS2 "
"/ HOLD（软件包 README）。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md:18
#: c3b3d29584114a4e9263da753f123b58
msgid ""
"**OCS2 WBC Controller** (`ocs2_wbc_controller`) — private submodule; "
"全身控制. States and topics are in that package README after access."
msgstr ""
"**`OCS2 WBC Controller`**（`ocs2_wbc_controller`）— 私有子模块；全身控制。状态和话题在开通后的包 "
"README 里。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md:20
#: 0467a4ecf31643459f478f948c59a1ed
#, #
msgid ""
"FSM command values, Action / Service tables, and WBC Cartesian topics: "
"[FSM and Topics](4-fsm_and_topics.md). Controllers index: [Controllers "
"reference](../4-reference/controllers/0-index.md)."
msgstr ""
"FSM 命令取值、Action / Service 表以及 WBC 笛卡尔话题：[FSM "
"与话题](4-fsm_and_topics.md)。控制器索引：[控制器参考](../4-reference/controllers/0-index.md)。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md:22
#: 73f85cfeae4c4f0d858b113c7c1ff7b5
msgid ""
"`/body_target*`, `/head_target*`, `/mode_command`, and `WbcCurrentState` "
"need **`ocs2_wbc_controller`** and that robot’s 全身 launch/config. Default"
" mock demos (`demo.launch.py`) and 分体 do **not** imply those features are"
" present; capability bits are machine-dependent. Public Taku mock uses "
"`split_body.launch.py robot:=taku`; `full_body.launch.py robot:=taku` "
"still needs the private `ocs2_wbc_controller` submodule (shipping "
"`config/ocs2/fixed_base_tcp.info` is not enough)."
msgstr ""
"`/body_target*`、`/head_target*`、`/mode_command` 以及 `WbcCurrentState` 需要 "
"**`ocs2_wbc_controller`** 以及该机型的全身启动/配置。默认 mock "
"演示（`demo.launch.py`）和分体**并不表示**这些能力可用；能力位取决于机型。公开的 Taku mock 使用 "
"`split_body.launch.py robot:=taku`；`full_body.launch.py robot:=taku` "
"仍需要私有 `ocs2_wbc_controller` 子模块（描述里有 `config/ocs2/fixed_base_tcp.info` "
"并不够）。"

#~ msgid "Packages (do not invent)"
#~ msgstr "软件包（不要编造）"

